.TH SNAKE 6.SH NAMEsnake \- stay ahead of the snake.SH SYNOPSIS\fBsnake\fR.SH DESCRIPTIONYou are the\fBI\fRin a walled field, the money is the\fB$\fR,\fRand a snake chases you.  Reach the money before the snake reaches you.\fBh\fR, \fBj\fR, \fBk\fR and \fBl\fRmove you left, down, up and right;\fBx\fRquits..PPRun it from a login session, with TERM and TERMCAP set.  Started with noTERMCAP at all it stops with a bus error before it draws; see\fBDOC/README-BUSERR\fR.\fR.SH FILES.TP 12\fB/dd/GAMES/snake\fRthe scores..SH SEE ALSOworms, pacman